  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"2\">Lip gloss</b> from the <b data-index-in-node=\"19\" data-path-to-node=\"2\">Rich Vibes Collection</b> is a perfect combination of professional care and a liquid glass effect.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/lip-balm-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/lip-balm-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Its texture feels like an oil, while delivering a mirror-like shine with a multichrome glow on the lips, leaving them soft and delicate.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/lip-balm-07.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">It is formulated with a complex of 8 amino acids, vitamin E, and panthenol.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\">Purpose:</b> Moisturizes the lips like cosmeceuticals thanks to its rich oil texture. At the same time, it serves a decorative function—creating a liquid glass effect with a delicate shimmer on the lips.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/lip-balm-05.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\"><strong>Color: </strong>Neutral caramel with a shimmer inspired by r.e.m. beauty Wicked So Popular Lip Oil (neutral, multichrome).</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\">Fragrance:</b> Ca$hmere Vanilla</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\"> </p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\"><strong>Non-sticky</strong></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\">The fragrance leaves no bitter aftertaste</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,5,0\">Virtually weightless on the lips</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"> </h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"> </p>\n\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nW6Z2QXISxk\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/nW6Z2QXISxk</a></p></p>\n </div>\n</div>",
